# Anti-Ban Safety

- Pacing, warmup, delays, and role percents are safety controls (ADR 002).
- Do not remove or drastically shorten delays for “performance” without explicit human approval in the Feature Plan.
- Preserve per-tenant worker isolation while changing campaign code (ADR 001).
- See skill `antiban-campaign-safety` and agent `campaign-antiban`.
